    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43864" root="&#xA;                        نحو&#xA;                    " body-key="n1">
                        
                            2
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَحَّى</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>He put</i> a thing <i>aside,</i> or <i>away,</i> or
<i>apart;</i> (Msb;) <i>removed</i> it <i>from its place,</i> (Msb,
K, TA,) <i>placed</i> it <i>at a distance.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <i>He
made</i> a person <i>to turn away,</i> or <i>withdraw,</i> or
<i>retire,</i> from (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَنْ</span>) an affair. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَحَّى عَنْهُ الشَّىْءَ</span>
                        <i>He put aside,</i> or <i>away,</i> or <i>he warded off,</i> or
<i>removed, from him the thing.</i> See 4.

  </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
